    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2502517214a99c3031d8c08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂喂，请问是内恰的训练员吗？\n很抱歉突然打扰，我是栗东宿舍长富士奇石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0777b47fb454224525fb9134e426ca7500fb97bae444d4a86b62f491ae6cb8d",
