      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冲在最前面了，东海帝王!　就这样继续拉开差距……\n到达终点！两马身之差，东海帝王的胜利！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b360f99598ae265645e4a3c5f8a26a8f20c522ebfcb027908154e895ef1a9d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
